                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 15.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Extract from civil code of the Federal District and
                        Lower California</hi>.</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chapter III</hi>.—<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Of property considered according to the persons to whom
                        it belongs.</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art</hi>. 698. Public property in that which
                        belongs to the federation, to the States, and to the municipalities.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art</hi>. 699. Public property shall be
                        governed by the provisions of this code when not determined by special laws;
                        it is subject in all cases to the rules for prescription established by the
                        same.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
